        "id": 1942356
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-07-12T22:00:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is for this test case only because of the inline assembly.  It apparently breaks on a clang update if not provided.  We don\u0027t want it defined for all kselftests.",
      "parentUuid": "36a4df9f_88b4f0f7",
