      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-07-12T22:00:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "oh I suppose we want to have frame-pointer enabled for every other case.\n\nI wonder why it breaks `do_full_int80()` specifically though. Is this some external issue that needs to be fixed? This sounds like a temporary work-around.",
